      "content": "exactly. it's just a cruel demand. everyone keeps talking about \"rebuilding\" or \"new chapters\" like i'm some project that can be fixed. but you can't fix something that's fundamentally broken at the core. if the essence of who i am was tied to that movement/that grace... then what's left? it feels like i'm just existing out of habit, dragging this useless shell around. wouldn't it just be easier to let the ruins go?",
